{
  "id": "506",
  "title": "Reschedule",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-04-18",
  "synopsis": "Manager Wang needs to reschedule a meeting due to an urgent business trip.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/710/fc06eab59970dbf8767da26fd4ea1ea67e9c23ec.mp3?1698351358",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "改时间\n\n王总：小何，天津分公司那边有些急事。你准备准备，和我去天津。\n小何：王总，今天您有和长城公司陈总的会面。需要改时间吗？\n王总：对哦！和陈总约了几点来着？\n小何：下午2点。\n王总：现在已经10点了，赶不回来了。这样吧，我让小张帮我打电话给陈总另约时间。你去准备一下，我们马上出发。\n小何：好的。",
    "traditional": "改時間\n\n王總：小何，天津分公司那邊有些急事。你準備準備，和我去天津。\n小何：王總，今天您有和長城公司陳總的會面。需要改時間嗎？\n王總：對哦！和陳總約了幾點來著？\n小何：下午2點。\n王總：現在已經10點了，趕不回來了。這樣吧，我讓小張幫我打電話給陳總另約時間。你去準備一下，我們馬上出發。\n小何：好的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Reschedule"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王总：小何，天津分公司那边有些急事。你准备准备，和我去天津。",
      "traditional": "王總：小何，天津分公司那邊有些急事。你準備準備，和我去天津。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng xiǎo hé tiān jīn fēn gōng sī nà bian yǒu xiē jí shì nǐ zhǔn bèi zhǔn bèi hé wǒ qù tiān jīn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Little He, there's an urgent matter at the Tianjin branch. Get ready and come with me to Tianjin."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：王总，今天您有和长城公司陈总的会面。",
      "traditional": "小何：王總，今天您有和長城公司陳總的會面。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wáng zǒng jīn tiān nín yǒu hé cháng chéng gōng sī chén zǒng de huì miàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "需要改时间吗？",
      "traditional": "需要改時間嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xū yào gǎi shí jiān ma",
      "english": "Little He: Manager Wang, you have a meeting with Manager Chen from the Great Wall Company today."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Should I reschedule?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "王总：对哦！和陈总约了几点来着？",
      "traditional": "王總：對哦！和陳總約了幾點來著？",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng duì o hé chén zǒng yuē le jǐ diǎn lái zhe",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Oh, right! What time was the meeting with Manager Chen again?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小何：下午2点。",
      "traditional": "小何：下午2點。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé xià wǔ 1 diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: 2 PM."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "王总：现在已经10点了，赶不回来了。",
      "traditional": "王總：現在已經10點了，趕不回來了。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng xiàn zài yǐ jīng 1 diǎn le gǎn bù huí lái le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "这样吧，我让小张帮我打电话给陈总另约时间。",
      "traditional": "這樣吧，我讓小張幫我打電話給陳總另約時間。",
      "pinyin": "zhè yàng ba wǒ ràng xiǎo zhāng bāng wǒ dǎ diàn huà gěi chén zǒng lìng yuē shí jiān",
      "english": "Manager Zong: It's already 10 o'clock now. We won't make it back in time."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "你去准备一下，我们马上出发。",
      "traditional": "你去準備一下，我們馬上出發。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ qù zhǔn bèi yí xià wǒ men mǎ shàng chū fā",
      "english": "How about this: I'll ask Little Zhang to call Manager Chen and book a new time for me."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Go get ready. We're leaving soon."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "小何：好的。",
      "traditional": "小何：好的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Alright."
    }
  ],
